TITLE River water and Seawater mixing

SOLUTION 1 River water
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10
    Na      10      charge
    temp    25

SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH      8.1
    Cl      19000
    Na      19000   charge
    temp    25

MIX 1
    1   0.7
    2   0.3

SAVE SOLUTION 3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   mixing_output.sel
    -reset  false
    -solution
    -molalities  Cl-

END
